{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/debug-laravel-app/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Yerin Blog"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"38faa01b-682b-5e71-8956-5804d5d4aa7f","excerpt":"1. Laravel Debugbar 1.1 Add requirement 1.2 Change config 1.3 Publish ### 1.4 Check  1.5 Clear cache & config ## 2. Xdebug + VS code + macOS","html":"<h2>1. Laravel Debugbar</h2>\n<h3>1.1 Add requirement</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ php composer.phar require barryvdh/laravel-debugbar <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--dev</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>1.2 Change config</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"php\"><pre class=\"language-php\"><code class=\"language-php\">diff <span class=\"token operator\">--</span>git a<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>config<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>app<span class=\"token operator\">.</span>php b<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>config<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>app<span class=\"token operator\">.</span>php\nindex <span class=\"token number\">3</span>c5820c4<span class=\"token operator\">.</span><span class=\"token number\">.8</span>ddaee54 <span class=\"token number\">100644</span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">--</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span> a<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>config<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>app<span class=\"token operator\">.</span>php\n<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token operator\">+</span> b<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>config<span class=\"token operator\">/</span>app<span class=\"token operator\">.</span>php\n@@ <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">200</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token number\">6</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span><span class=\"token number\">200</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span> @@ <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n \n         <span class=\"token class-name class-name-fully-qualified static-context\">App<span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>Providers<span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>GoogleDriveServiceProvider</span><span class=\"token operator\">::</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n \n<span class=\"token operator\">+</span>        <span class=\"token comment\">/*\n+         * Laravel Debugbar\n+         */</span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">+</span>        <span class=\"token class-name class-name-fully-qualified static-context\">Barryvdh<span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>Debugbar<span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>ServiceProvider</span><span class=\"token operator\">::</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n     <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n \n     <span class=\"token comment\">/*\n@@ -258,6 +262,10 @@ return [\n         'Excel'        => Maatwebsite\\Excel\\Facades\\Excel::class,\n         'PDF'          => Barryvdh\\DomPDF\\Facade::class,\n \n+        /*\n+         * Debugbar Aliases\n+         */</span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">+</span>        <span class=\"token string single-quoted-string\">'Debugbar'</span>     <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token class-name class-name-fully-qualified static-context\">Barryvdh<span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>Debugbar<span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>Facade</span><span class=\"token operator\">::</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n     <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n \n <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>1.3 Publish</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ php artisan vendor:publish <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--provider</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Barryvdh\\Debugbar\\ServiceProvider\"</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>### 1.4 Check <code class=\"language-text\">.env</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"ini\"><pre class=\"language-ini\"><code class=\"language-ini\"><span class=\"token key attr-name\">APP_DEBUG</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token value attr-value\">true</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>1.5 Clear cache &#x26; config</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ php artisan cache:clear\n$ php artisan config:cache</code></pre></div>\n<p>## 2. Xdebug + VS code + macOS</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Debug laravel app","date":"May 09, 2023","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/magento-mac-setup-apache/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Setup Magento 2 with Apache on MacOS"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/colab-getting-started-vscode/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Getting started with colab + vscode"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"38faa01b-682b-5e71-8956-5804d5d4aa7f","previousPostId":"ad03da7d-e832-5af2-bcfa-c5ba534ad03e","nextPostId":"d379257a-b574-5eeb-8d71-676eee86db7f"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383","3257411868"]}